sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Parent (sentinelbox)
    participant M as Monitor (Rust)
    participant C as Child (clone)
    participant K as Linux Kernel

    P->>P: socketpair(sv[0], sv[1])
    P->>M: fork+exec monitor, 傳 sv[1] 為 fd 3
    P->>P: pipe2(sync_pipe)
    P->>K: clone(CLONE_NEWPID|NEWUSER|NEWNS|<br/>NEWNET|NEWIPC|NEWUTS|NEWCGROUP)
    K-->>C: 子進入新 namespaces (uid=65534)
    P->>P: 寫 /proc/<pid>/setgroups=deny
    P->>P: 寫 uid_map / gid_map<br/>(0 → host_uid)
    P->>C: write(sync_pipe, host_pid)
    P->>P: cgroup attach (memory/cpu/pids)
    C->>C: setresuid(0,0,0)  // 沙盒內 root
    C->>K: tmpfs + overlay mount<br/>pivot_root + umount old
    C->>K: mount fresh /proc (or rbind fallback)
    C->>C: sethostname / prctl(NO_NEW_PRIVS)
    C->>C: cap_drop(SYS_ADMIN, NET_ADMIN, ...)
    C->>K: seccomp_load(filter w/ NOTIFY rules)
    K-->>C: notify_fd
    C->>M: sendmsg + SCM_RIGHTS(notify_fd)
    C->>K: execve(target_program)
    Note over M,K: Monitor 開始 poll notify_fd<br/>等待違規 syscall 觸發
